TI  - Smart Muni Platform: Efficient Emergency and Citizen Security Management Based on Geolocation, Technological Integration and Real Time Communication
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ADVANCED COMPUTER SCIENCE AND APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Citizen security
KW  - geolocation
KW  - emergency management
KW  - cloud technology
