TI  - How to overcome hurdles in opiate substitution treatment? A qualitative study with general practitioners in Belgium
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF GENERAL PRACTICE
LA  - English
KW  - Public health
KW  - community medicine
KW  - healthcare organization
KW  - qualitative methods
KW  - METHADONE-MAINTENANCE TREATMENT
KW  - PRIMARY-CARE
