TI  - Patterns of alcohol consumption in France and their medical and social consequences as seen through the family circle and friends and general practitioners
T2  - ENCEPHALE-REVUE DE PSYCHIATRIE CLINIQUE BIOLOGIQUE ET THERAPEUTIQUE
LA  - French
KW  - Alcohol drinking
KW  - Alcohol-induced disorders
