TI  - Physicians Taking Action Against Smoking: an intervention program to optimize smoking cessation counselling by Montreal general practitioners
T2  - CANADIAN MEDICAL ASSOCIATION JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - MOBILIZING PHYSICIANS
KW  - PREVENTIVE CARE
KW  - TOBACCO USE
KW  - BARRIERS
