TI  - A just-in-time adaptive personalized mobile app intervention produces limited short-term reductions in heavy episodic drinking frequency in college students: A randomized control trial during the COVID-19 pandemic
T2  - ALCOHOL-CLINICAL AND EXPERIMENTAL RESEARCH
