TI  - General practitioners' commitment to treating excessive alcohol consumption: A question of role security in treating affected patients?
T2  - ZEITSCHRIFT FUR EVIDENZ FORTBILDUNG UND QUALITAET IM GESUNDHEITSWESEN
LA  - German
KW  - Medical studies
KW  - alcohol
KW  - primary care
