TI  - Effect of weediness on the water content of the soil:: A field study
T2  - COMMUNICATIONS IN SOIL SCIENCE AND PLANT ANALYSIS
LA  - English
KW  - water content of soil
KW  - weediness
KW  - maize
KW  - weeds
KW  - biomass production
