TI  - A Latent Spatial Factor Approach for Synthesizing Opioid-Associated Deaths and Treatment Admissions in Ohio Counties
T2  - EPIDEMIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Bayesian hierarchical modeling
KW  - Disease mapping
KW  - Multivariate
