TI  - RNA-sequencing predicts three novel genes in response to drought in electron beam irradiation treated tobacco
T2  - ACTA PHYSIOLOGIAE PLANTARUM
LA  - English
KW  - Electron beam irradiation
KW  - Nicotiana tabacum L.
KW  - Drought
KW  - Germination percentage
