TI  - MCMTC: A Pragmatic Framework for Selecting an Experimental Design to Inform the Development of Digital Interventions
T2  - FRONTIERS IN DIGITAL HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Sequential Multiple Assignment Randomized Trial (SMART)
