TI  - BEYOND EFFECTIVENESS: BARRIERS AND SOLUTIONS FOR IMPLEMENTING BRIEF ALCOHOL INTERVENTIONS IN PRIMARY CARE IN CZECHIA
T2  - ALKOHOLIZM I NARKOMANIA-ALCOHOLISM AND DRUG ADDICTION
LA  - English
