TI  - Assessing the performance of the generalized propensity score for estimating the effect of quantitative or continuous exposures on survival or time-to-event outcomes
T2  - STATISTICAL METHODS IN MEDICAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Propensity score
KW  - generalized propensity score
