TI  - DO GENERAL-PRACTITIONERS AND GENERAL PSYCHIATRISTS WANT TO LOOK AFTER DRUG MISUSERS - EVALUATION OF A NONSPECIALIST TREATMENT POLICY
T2  - BRITISH JOURNAL OF GENERAL PRACTICE
