TI  - Guilty until proven innocent: A qualitative study of the management of chronic non-cancer pain among patients with a history of substance abuse
T2  - ADDICTIVE BEHAVIORS
LA  - English
KW  - Chronic non cancer pain
KW  - Opioid prescribing
KW  - Substance abuse
