TI  - In-practice management versus quitline referral for enhancing smoking cessation in general practice: a cluster randomized trial
T2  - FAMILY PRACTICE
LA  - English
KW  - Cluster randomized controlled trial
KW  - GPs
KW  - primary care
KW  - referral
KW  - smoking cessation
KW  - PRACTITIONERS
KW  - PROMOTION
