TI  - B-phosphatidylethanol testing to identify hazardous alcohol use in primary health care-a game changer and a challenge for general practitioners: a qualitative study
T2  - SCANDINAVIAN JOURNAL OF PRIMARY HEALTH CARE
LA  - English
KW  - Addiction medicine
KW  - alcohol dependence
