TI  - Probabilistic volcanic impact assessment and cost-benefit analysis on network infrastructure for secondary evacuation of farm livestock: A case study from the dairy industry, Taranaki, New Zealand
T2  - JOURNAL OF VOLCANOLOGY AND GEOTHERMAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Volcanic hazards
KW  - Volcanic risk
