TI  - A district-level geospatial analysis of anaemia prevalence among rural men in India, 2019-21
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL FOR EQUITY IN HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Men's anaemia
KW  - Men's health
KW  - India
KW  - Spatial analysis
