TI  - Types of follow-up offered by general practitioners to adolescents presenting self-aggressive or suicidal behavior Ancillary study to MICAS (physicians investigating teenagers in consultation)
T2  - EXERCER-LA REVUE FRANCOPHONE DE MEDECINE GENERALE
