TI  - Spatial clustering and route-based analysis of DUI incidents for enhancing traffic enforcement deployment
T2  - TRAFFIC INJURY PREVENTION
LA  - English
KW  - Driving under the influence of alcohol
KW  - spatial analysis
KW  - hotspot analysis
KW  - traffic enforcement deployment
KW  - traffic safety strategies
KW  - KERNEL DENSITY-ESTIMATION
