TI  - Ultra-rapid opiate detoxification using deep sedation and prior oral buprenorphine preparation: long-term results
T2  - DRUG AND ALCOHOL DEPENDENCE
LA  - English
KW  - ultra-rapid opioid detoxification
KW  - naloxone
KW  - naltrexone
KW  - buprenorphine
