TI  - How far do they go?: A spatial examination of missing persons from hospitals
T2  - POLICING-AN INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF POLICE STRATEGIES & MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Missing persons
KW  - Police investigations
KW  - Human geography
