AB  - Crude Gynostemma pentaphyllum Makino polysaccharide was extracted by water extraction and ethanol precipitation. After purification by depectinization and decolourisation, polysaccharide GPS-3 was obtained by purification using Q Sepharose Fast Flow and Superdex 200 columns. Furthermore, the protective effects of GPS-3 on alcoholic hepatic injuries of mice were studied. Results showd that GPS-3 had significant protective effects on alcoholic hepatic injuries.
