TI  - Assessment of forest fire severity and land surface temperature using Google Earth Engine: a case study of Gujarat State, India
T2  - FIRE ECOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Wildfire susceptibility mapping
KW  - LST
KW  - Random forest
KW  - GEE
