TI  - Enhancing national data to align with policy objectives: Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander smoking prevalence at finer geographic levels
T2  - AUSTRALIAN HEALTH REVIEW
LA  - English
KW  - COMMUNITIES
KW  - PEOPLES
KW  - HEALTH
