TI  - Why do general practitioners work with opiate misusers?: a qualitative study of high and low activity general practitioners
T2  - DRUGS-EDUCATION PREVENTION AND POLICY
LA  - English
KW  - METHADONE-MAINTENANCE
KW  - ALCOHOL-PROBLEMS
