TI  - Emissions of formaldehyde, acetic acid, methanol, and other trace gases from biomass fires in North Carolina measured by airborne Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy
T2  - JOURNAL OF GEOPHYSICAL RESEARCH-ATMOSPHERES
LA  - English
KW  - DIODE-LASER SPECTROMETER
KW  - TROPICAL SOUTH-ATLANTIC
