TI  - Prevalence of eating disorders in South Asian countries: a systematic analysis of Global Burden of Disease (1990-2021)
T2  - EATING AND WEIGHT DISORDERS-STUDIES ON ANOREXIA BULIMIA AND OBESITY
LA  - English
KW  - Appetite disorders
KW  - Binge-eating disorder
KW  - Food addiction
KW  - South Asia
