TI  - "I'll give up smoking when you get me better": patients' resistance to attempts to problematise smoking in general practice (GP) consultations
T2  - SOCIAL SCIENCE & MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - GP/patient interaction
KW  - smoking
KW  - conversation analysis
KW  - UK
